        "Description": "The Ark Society harbors many dark secrets, but none so dangerous as Roman Zelenko. Whispers speak of his mastery over death, calling him a necromancer whose foul rituals defy the natural order.\r\rZelenko stands on the brink of achieving immortality. If not stopped now, he will take the throne and plunge the realm into darkness.\r\rInfiltrate the Ark Society, seek out this accursed sorcerer, and vanquish him for the good of the land. The fate of all rests upon your blade, XLVII.",
